[{"id":"Mjg0-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jumlah dua bilangan bulat yang berbeda adalah 14. Jika hasil bagi kedua bilangan tersebut adalah juga bilangan bulat, maka salah satu bilangan yang mungkin adalah ......","choices":["2","4","6","7","9<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0Mjk"},{"id":"Mjg0-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{1}{12}=\\frac{1}{x}, \\: \\: maka\\sqrt{x}=....\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B6%7D&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B12%7D%3D%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bx%7D%2C%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20maka%5Csqrt%7Bx%7D%3D....\" /></p>","choices":["4","4 dan-4","2","2 dan-2","Tidak ada jawaban yang benar.<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0MzA"},{"id":"Mjg0-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada suatu peta tertulis perbandingan 1:200.000. Jika jarak antara dua kota adalah 50 km, maka jarak kedua kota itu dalam peta adalah .......","choices":["0,25 cm","2,5 cm","25 cm","1cm","10 cm<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0MzE"},{"id":"Mjg0-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Ali, Ani, dan Budi pergi ke suatu toko untuk membeli pensil dan buku yang sama. Ali membeli dua pensil dan dua buku, Ani membeli tiga pensil dan 4 buku, sedangkan Budi membeli satu pensil dan dua buku. Jika Ali dan Ani berturut-turut membayar Rp 2.500,- dan Rp 4.500,-, maka Budi harus membayar.......","choices":["Rp 1000,-","Rp 1500,-","Rp 2000,-","Rp 2500,-","Rp &nbsp;300,-<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0MzI"},{"id":"Mjg0-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diberikan kerucut dengan volume 77 <img alt=\"cm^3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?cm%5E3\" />. Jika tinggi kerucut itu 6 cm, maka jari-jari alasnya adalah .......&nbsp;<img alt=\"(\\pi \\frac{22}{7})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28%5Cpi%20%5Cfrac%7B22%7D%7B7%7D%29\" />","choices":["2 cm","3,5 cm","7 cm","10,3 cm","12,25 cm<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0MzM"},{"id":"Mjg0-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika panjang diagonal suatu persegi adalah 4 cm, maka luas persegi itu (dalam cm2) adalah.......","choices":["2","4","6","8","16<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0MzQ"},{"id":"Mjg0-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bilangan asli n sedemikian sehingga hasil kali</p><p><img alt=\"(1+\\frac{1}{2})(1+\\frac{1}{3})(1+\\frac{1}{4}).......(1+\\frac{1}{n})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%281&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%29%281&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B3%7D%29%281&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B4%7D%29.......%281&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bn%7D%29\" /></p><p>merupakan bilangan bulat adalah .......","choices":["n ganjil","n genap","n kelipatan 3","n sebarang","tidak ada n yang memenuhi<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0MzU"},{"id":"Mjg0-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Selisih terbesar dari 2 bilangan rasional x yang memenuhi pertidaksamaan&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{5}&lt;2x&lt;\\frac{1}{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B5%7D%3C2x%3C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D\" />&nbsp;, adalah....</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{20}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B20%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{10}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B10%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{8}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B8%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{80}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B80%7D\" />","Jawaban A, B, C dan D salah&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0MzY"},{"id":"Mjg0-q09","number":9,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan A = {1,2,3} dan B = {a,b,c}. Banyaknya korespondensi satu-satu yang dapat dibuat dari A ke B adalah .......","choices":["1","3","6","9","27<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0Mzc"},{"id":"Mjg0-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Seorang Ayah berumur 39 tahun mempunyai dua orang anak bernama Budi dan Wati. Tahun depan, selisih umur Ayah dan Budi dibandingkan dengan selisih umur Ayah dan Wati adalah 14 : 19. Jika umur Ayah sekarang adalah tiga kali umur Budi ditambah enam kali umur Wati, maka jumlah umur Budi dan Wati tiga tahun yang akan datang adalah .......","choices":["17","18","19","20","21<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0Mzg"},{"id":"Mjg0-q11","number":11,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu garis lurus memotong sumbu X di titik A(a,0) dan memotong sumbu Y di titik B(0,b) dengan a dan b adalah bilangan bulat. Jika luas segitiga OAB adalah 12 satuan luas, maka banyaknya pasangan bilangan bulat a dan b yang mungkin adalah........","choices":["4 pasang","8 pasang","16 pasang","32 pasang","48 pasang<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0Mzk"},{"id":"Mjg0-q12","number":12,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan a, b, dan c adalah panjang sisi-sisi suatu segitiga, dengan a,b, dan c berupa bilangan asli berurutan yang rata-rata hitungnya 6. Jika ditarik garis tinggi terhadap sisi yang panjangnya b, maka panjang garis tinggi tersebut adalah.......</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"6\\sqrt{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?6%5Csqrt%7B6%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"4\\sqrt{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?4%5Csqrt%7B6%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"2\\sqrt{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2%5Csqrt%7B6%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"4\\sqrt{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?4%5Csqrt%7B2%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"2\\sqrt{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2%5Csqrt%7B2%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NDA"},{"id":"Mjg0-q13","number":13,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada segitiga PQR, S adalah titik tengah QP dan T titik tengah QR. Perbandingan antara TS dan QR adalah .......","choices":["1:2","1:3","&nbsp;2:3","3:4","3:5<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NDE"},{"id":"Mjg0-q14","number":14,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Luas daerah yang diarsir setengah dari luas daerah yang tidak diarsir .<br /> Panjang AB dibagi panjang AC adalah &hellip;&hellip;<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20210124090525.PNG\" style=\"height:156px; width:175px\" /></p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5Csqrt%7B2%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{3}\\sqrt{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B3%7D%5Csqrt%7B3%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{5}\\sqrt{5}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B5%7D%5Csqrt%7B5%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{7}\\sqrt{7}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B7%7D%5Csqrt%7B7%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{7}\\sqrt{5}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B7%7D%5Csqrt%7B5%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NDI"},{"id":"Mjg0-q15","number":15,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan m dan n adalah bilangan bulat dan 0 &lt; m &lt; n. Jika&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{m}+\\frac{1}{n}=\\frac{1}{3},\\: \\: maka\\: \\: \\frac{1}{m}-\\: \\frac{1}{n}=........\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bm%7D&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bn%7D%3D%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B3%7D%2C%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20maka%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bm%7D-%5C%3A%20%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bn%7D%3D........\" /></p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{2}{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B2%7D%7B3%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B6%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"-\\frac{1}{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?-%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B6%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"-\\frac{2}{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?-%5Cfrac%7B2%7D%7B3%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{5}{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B5%7D%7B6%7D\" /></p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NDM"},{"id":"Mjg0-q16","number":16,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Banyaknya bilangan bulat dari -1006 sampai dengan 2006 yang merupakan kelipatan 3 tetapi bukan kelipatan 6 adalah .......","choices":["500 bilangan","501 bilangan","502 bilangan","503 bilangan","504 bilangan<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NDQ"},{"id":"Mjg0-q17","number":17,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bentuk sederhana dari (y + x){(x - y)[x(x - y) + y(y + x)]} adalah .......","choices":["<img alt=\"x^4 + y^4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x%5E4%20&amp;plus;%20y%5E4\" />","<img alt=\"x^4 - y^4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x%5E4%20-%20y%5E4\" />","<img alt=\"y^4 - x^4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?y%5E4%20-%20x%5E4\" />","<img alt=\"(x^4 +y^4)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28x%5E4%20&amp;plus;y%5E4%29\" />","Jawaban A,B,C, dan D tidak ada yang benar.<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NDU"},{"id":"Mjg0-q18","number":18,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika <img alt=\"5\\leq x\\leq 10 \\: \\: dan\\: \\: 2 \\leq y \\leq 6\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?5%5Cleq%20x%5Cleq%2010%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20dan%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%202%20%5Cleq%20y%20%5Cleq%206\" /> , maka nilai minimum untuk (x - y)(x + y) adalah .......","choices":["-21","-12","&nbsp;-11","11","12<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NDY"},{"id":"Mjg0-q19","number":19,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan gambar di bawah ini. Jika CE = EB, AD = DB, besar&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\\angle\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cangle\" />&nbsp;ABC 30&deg;, dan panjang CA = 4 cm, maka panjang CF adalah .......</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20210124091459.PNG\" style=\"height:111px; width:174px\" /></p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{4}{3}\\sqrt{28}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B4%7D%7B3%7D%5Csqrt%7B28%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{3}\\sqrt{28}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B3%7D%5Csqrt%7B28%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{7}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B2%7D%7B3%7D%5Csqrt%7B7%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{4}{3}\\sqrt{7}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B4%7D%7B3%7D%5Csqrt%7B7%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{3}\\sqrt{7}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B3%7D%5Csqrt%7B7%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NDc"},{"id":"Mjg0-q20","number":20,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan gambar di bawah ini. Jika luas BCDE = luas ABE, dan panjang CD = panjang BE = .......","choices":["4","2&nbsp;","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\sqrt{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csqrt%7B2%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5Csqrt%7B2%7D\" />","Jawaban A,B,C, dan D tidak ada yang benar.<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NDg"},{"id":"Mjg0-q21","number":21,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Jika jumlah dua bilangan adalah 3 dan selisih kuadrat bilangan itu adalah 6, maka hasil kali kedua bilangan itu adalah .......</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NDk"},{"id":"Mjg0-q22","number":22,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Panjang jalan tol Bogor-Jakarta 60 km. Pada pukul 12.00 mobil A berangkat dari pintu tol Bogor menuju Jakarta dengan kecepatan rata-rata 80 km/jam. Pada saat yang sama mobil B berangkat dari pintu tol Jakarta menuju Bogor dengan kecepatan rata-rata 70 km/jam. Kedua mobil tersebut akan berpapasan pada pukul.......</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NTA"},{"id":"Mjg0-q23","number":23,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Jika pada segi n beraturan besar sudut-sudutnya 135&deg;, maka n = .......</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NTE"},{"id":"Mjg0-q24","number":24,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Semua bilangan bulat x sehingga <img alt=\"\\frac{1}{2+\\sqrt{x}}+\\frac{1}{2-\\sqrt{x}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2&amp;plus;%5Csqrt%7Bx%7D%7D&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2-%5Csqrt%7Bx%7D%7D\" />merupakan bilangan bulat adalah .......<br /> &nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NTI"},{"id":"Mjg0-q25","number":25,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Bilangan asli n terbesar sehingga jumlah 1 + 3 + 5 + ... + (2n - 1) lebih kecil 2006 adalah .......</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NTM"},{"id":"Mjg0-q26","number":26,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Semua pasangan bilangan real (x, y) yang memenuhi <img alt=\"x^2 + y^2 = 2x - 4y - 5\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x%5E2%20&amp;plus;%20y%5E2%20%3D%202x%20-%204y%20-%205\" />adalah .......</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NTQ"},{"id":"Mjg0-q27","number":27,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan gambar di bawah ini. Jika panjang AB = 2 cm, panjang CD = 3 cm, dan panjang AC = 9 cm, maka panjang BC adalah ......</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20210124092537.PNG\" style=\"height:125px; width:175px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NTU"},{"id":"Mjg0-q28","number":28,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Banyaknya faktor dari 4200 yang merupakan bilangan ganjil positif adalah&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&hellip;&hellip;..</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NTY"},{"id":"Mjg0-q29","number":29,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><img alt=\"\\frac{2006}{1.2}+\\frac{2006}{2.3}+\\frac{2006}{3.4}+....+\\frac{2006}{2005.2006}-.....\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B2006%7D%7B1.2%7D&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B2006%7D%7B2.3%7D&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B2006%7D%7B3.4%7D&amp;plus;....&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B2006%7D%7B2005.2006%7D-.....\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NTc"},{"id":"Mjg0-q30","number":30,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan gambar di bawah ini. Jika panjang AB = 3 cm, panjang AD = 8 cm, panjang CD = 5 cm, dan titik E terletak pada ruas garis BC, maka panjang minimal dari A E + ED adalah .......</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\" https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20210124094200.PNG\" style=\"height:207px; width:262px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTE0NTg"}]
